\series default
; the times of the lines are displayed as marks in the editor (
\series bold
Clear Profile Marks
\series default
 removes them). The profile measures the CPU time (waiting or sleeping is not counted).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
Simulation Models and the Export as HTML Page
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "subsec:Simulation-API"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The simulation API of Bio7 (the package 
\family typewriter
com.eco.bio7.simulation
\family default
) is an easy way to create simulation models in Java: a model implements 
\family typewriter
init()
\family default
 (the start state) and 
\family typewriter
step()
\family default
 (one time step), runs live in Bio7 (in ImageJ, in the 3D view or on the WorldWind globe) and can be exported as an interactive HTML page: the model is translated to JavaScript and runs in the web browser with the same results. The settings of the model become sliders, checkboxes and choices in Bio7 and in the page.
\end_layout

