\begin_layout Itemize
Parallel computation: 
\family typewriter
IntStream.range(0, height).parallel().forEach(y -> ...)
\family default
 computes the rows (or the agents) in parallel threads of Java (the browser runs a loop). In the threads 
\family typewriter
randomAt(index, k)
\family default
 gives the random numbers: it is computed from the seed, the time step and the index, so the results are the same in any order of the threads. Each thread writes only its own cells (
\family typewriter
setNext
\family default
) or its own agent.
\end_layout

