\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Write the computations in the code file (
\family typewriter
server.R
\family default
 or 
\family typewriter
app.js
\family default
). After changes of the design export the GUI again.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The design file (
\family typewriter
ui.R
\family default
